<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to 26 June - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to 26 June - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and</p>
<p>related markets rose to $1.202 trillion in the week to June 26</p>
<p>from $1.041 trillion in the previous week, International</p>
<p>Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of</p>
<p>dollars).</p>
<p>					    LATEST WEEK	  PREVIOUS WEEK</p>
<p> PRIMARY MARKET:			  61.92		    57.37</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	 32.38		    24.63</p>
<p> SECONDARY MARKET:		    1140.50		   984.09</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	257.02		   260.55</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH EUROCLEAR	   864.84		   746.05</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH CEDEL		 337.58		   295.41</p>
<p>--London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
